}
if (%wolf_bones_taken ! 0) {
    // No source found: searching again once the bones are taken and gone (.claude/647-wolf-whistle-states.md section
    // 11). The pack is empty: the talk ends here, and wolves drop wolf bones (2011 wiki, Wolf
