// 2011's: d04: WKPggURQByY 2011-10-30 @178; zGpeA1CrlVg 2010-11-28 @44.
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>Let's see what he has in his pack: three unfinished Strength potions, two burnt lobsters, a guam leaf with a footprint on it...");
// 2011's: d05: WKPggURQByY 2011-10-30 @179; zGpeA1CrlVg 2010-11-28 @45.
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>and some wolf bones!");
